Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.86,0:01:15.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利 把枪给我\N{\fs50}Henry, give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:17.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来 把枪给我\N{\fs50}Come on, give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:18.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做了什么？\N{\fs50}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.57,0:01:20.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fs50}Gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:22.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我 亨利\N{\fs50}Gimme the gun, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fs50}Gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:26.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利 不要！\N{\fs50}Henry, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,枪也放下\N{\fs50}And the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:31.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈是谁？\N{\fs50}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:33.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是路过的人\N{\fs50}Just someone passin' through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪拿出来 只用两根手指 放在够不着的地方\N{\fs50}Take the gun out, two fingers only, put it outta reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:47.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为啥不开枪打他？\N{\fs50}Why didn't you shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,枪都在那边呢\N{\fs50}The gun's all the way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:53.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,顺带一提 他没伤害我\N{\fs50}He didn't hurt me, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:54.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我不瞎\N{\fs50}Yeah, I got eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:57.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还给他煮了汤？\N{\fs50}You made him soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:59.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我煮了\N{\fs50}Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:00.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,外边多冷啊\N{\fs50}It's cold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:01.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在找我弟弟\N{\fs50}I'm lookin' for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哼 这我没见着\N{\fs50}Well, I ain't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还没和你说他的样子\N{\fs50}I haven't told you what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他长得像你吗？\N{\fs50}He look anything like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:08.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有点吧\N{\fs50}A bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:09.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我就没见着\N{\fs50}Then I ain't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他还带着个女孩儿\N{\fs50}He's got a girl with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:13.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能下来吗？\N{\fs50}Can I come down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:15.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行 艾莉！\N{\fs50}No. Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:20.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚怎么说的？\N{\fs50}What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,算了吧 乔尔 他们看着有一千岁了\N{\fs50}Joel, come on. They're like a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:24.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个小疯子是谁？\N{\fs50}Who's this little psycho?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:25.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别管她\N{\fs50}Never mind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:26.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要你告诉我们所在的位置\N{\fs50}I need you to tell us where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:28.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你都有地图了 怎么还会迷路？\N{\fs50}If you got a map, why you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,肯定是错过了他妈的大树林里的所有路标吧\N{\fs50}Must've missed all the street signs in the enormous fucking forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fs50}Ho-ly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:37.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们在这一带 具体是哪里？\N{\fs50}We're somewhere here. Exactly where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:40.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的答案最好和你老婆的一样\N{\fs50}And your answer better be the same as your wife's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:42.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你和他说真话了吗？\N{\fs50}Did you tell him the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:44.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:46.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你和我说真话了吗？\N{\fs50}Are you tellin' me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:04.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 看来你找的藏身地很不错\N{\fs50}Well, you found a great place to hide, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,藏？\N{\fs50}Hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:08.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你出生前我就来这了 小子\N{\fs50}Came here before you were born, sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:10.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,离所有人都他妈远远的\N{\fs50}Get the hell away from everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我当初不想跟他来的\N{\fs50}I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:16.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 我无意让你担心你兄弟\N{\fs50}Listen, I didn't mean to upset you about your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你都走了这么远\N{\fs50}but if you've come this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:20.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你肯定知道外边有些啥\N{\fs50}then you know what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:21.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,见过科迪的情况了？\N{\fs50}You seen Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:22.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 就近看了\N{\fs50}Yeah, got close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:23.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那里到处都是感染者\N{\fs50}It's crawling with Infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:27.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 拉勒米还有风河保留区\N{\fs50}Yeah, Laramie and Wind River Reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:30.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,以前有人住的地方 现在都不能去了\N{\fs50}Anywhere people used to be, you can't go there no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:31.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你没听过汤米这个名字？\N{\fs50}So you haven't heard the name Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:32.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fs50}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听过火萤吗？\N{\fs50}What about the Fireflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,夏天会有\N{\fs50}We get those in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是虫子 是说人\N{\fs50}Not the bugs, the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:39.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,外边还有火萤人？\N{\fs50}There are firefly people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:46.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道去西边哪条路最好走吗？\N{\fs50}You got any advice on the best way west?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:46.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,向东走\N{\fs50}Go east.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:53.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你不能穿过这条河\N{\fs50}But you never go past the river here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:55.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,绝对不能\N{\fs50}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,河那边有什么？\N{\fs50}What's past the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:58.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fs50}Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:01.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没见过那伙人\N{\fs50}We never seen who's out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:04.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们见过他们留下的尸体\N{\fs50}but we see the bodies they leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有些是感染者 有些不是\N{\fs50}Some Infected, some not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:12.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你兄弟去了河西岸 那他肯定没了\N{\fs50}If your brother's west of the river, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你吓不着我们的\N{\fs50}You're not gonna scare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:20.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,已经吓着他了\N{\fs50}Scared him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:36.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不会真信了他们吧\N{\fs50}You don't seriously believe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:38.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在这里住了很久\N{\fs50}They've lived here a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:40.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放回去\N{\fs50}Put that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们啥都不知道\N{\fs50}They don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,火萤都没听过\N{\fs50}Never heard of the Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel? Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 你没事吧？\N{\fs50}Joel, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:53.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:53.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fs50}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:54.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操 你要死了吗？\N{\fs50}Holy shit, are you dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:56.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fs50}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:58.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好了 好了 - 那好 你还好吗？\N{\fs50}- Okay, okay. - Okay, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我还好 - 不不 你真的好吗？\N{\fs50}- I'm fine. - No, no, but are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,提醒一下 你要死了我也就完犊子了\N{\fs50}Because just a reminder that if you're dead, I'm fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:03.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我说了我没事 - 好\N{\fs50}- I said I'm fine. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:08.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是一下子吸到了冷空气\N{\fs50}It's just the cold air all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:13.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:18.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我们去找汤米和火萤吧\N{\fs50}So let's go and find Tommy and the Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,简单得很\N{\fs50}It's gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱只需要跨过死亡之河\N{\fs50}All we have to do is cross the River of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:52.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,死亡之河 好吓人哦\N{\fs50}The River of Death. Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fs50}Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:58.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天快黑了\N{\fs50}It's too close to dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,河边有些洞穴\N{\fs50}There's some caves along the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们过去宿营 早上再过河\N{\fs50}We'll set up camp there, cross in the mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:04.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 我饿死了\N{\fs50}Good. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,应该偷两只兔子的\N{\fs50}Should've stolen two rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:06.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们能自己抓兔子\N{\fs50}We can get our own rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要教我吗？\N{\fs50}You gonna teach me how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,赶紧走吧\N{\fs50}Just keep movin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从那儿下来 小心摔断脖子\N{\fs50}Come down from there. You're gonna break your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:56.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能来点吗？\N{\fs50}Can I have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:57.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？就暖暖身子嘛\N{\fs50}What? Just to warm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来点嘛\N{\fs50}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:16.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咳 还是喝着恶心\N{\fs50}Yep, still gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我一直在想\N{\fs50}So I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:30.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果咱找到了火萤 一切顺利进行\N{\fs50}Let's say we find the Fireflies, it all works,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:32.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们给我抽血 然后放进\N{\fs50}they draw my blood and put it through
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:34.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么牛逼机器里 制造出了特效药\N{\fs50}some of their fancy machines and make a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:38.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,之后咋办？\N{\fs50}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:40.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就 我们再干什么好？\N{\fs50}Like, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:41.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我们”？\N{\fs50}It's "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 随便 就你\N{\fs50}Okay, fine. Whatever. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想做什么都可以\N{\fs50}You can do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿 你要干什么？\N{\fs50}Where are you going, what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,以前从来没得选\N{\fs50}It's never been an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能会\N{\fs50}Maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:58.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找间旧农舍 弄点地\N{\fs50}an old farmhouse, some land
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:00.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,搞个牧场\N{\fs50}a ranch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:02.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,酷啊 牧场养啥？\N{\fs50}Cool. What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:03.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,绵羊\N{\fs50}Sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:06.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 养绵羊吧 - 绵羊啊\N{\fs50}- I would raise sheep. - Sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它们很安静\N{\fs50}They're quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:11.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且听话\N{\fs50}do what they're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 行 随你说\N{\fs50}Yeah, yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.05,0:09:16.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 就你和一群绵羊\N{\fs50}So, just you and a buncha sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:18.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好浪漫哦\N{\fs50}Romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你呢？你要去哪儿？\N{\fs50}And what about you? Where are you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能因为我在隔离区长大\N{\fs50}It's probably because I grew up in the QZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:34.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,身后是海\N{\fs50}Behind you, there's ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:37.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,面前是墙\N{\fs50}and ahead of you, there's a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:38.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只能往上看了\N{\fs50}Nowhere else to look but up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:41.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我把学校图书馆里能找到的都读了\N{\fs50}I read everything I could in the school library.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:45.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,尼尔·阿姆斯特朗 巴兹·奥尔德林 吉姆·洛弗尔\N{\fs50}Neil Armstrong, Buzz Aldrin, Jim Lovell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:46.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你知道我最喜欢谁吗？\N{\fs50}But you know who my favorite is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,萨莉·赖德\N{\fs50}Sally Ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:50.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,牛逼的萨莉·赖德！\N{\fs50}Sally fuckin' Ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:51.27,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs48}萨莉·赖德：美国航天员、物理学家，是世界上第三位、美国第一位进入太空的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:55.00,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs48}现实中，赖德在{\b1}2012年{\b0}去世后的讣告中公开了她的同性伴侣塔姆·奥肖内西，\N成为世界上第一位公开出柜的LGBT宇航员
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这名字跟宇航员不能再配了\N{\fs50}Best astronaut name ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会有效的 对吧？\N{\fs50}It'll work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:09.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我指疫苗\N{\fs50}The vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:12.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这会儿质疑有点晚了\N{\fs50}It's a little late to start wonderin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我试过了 在山姆身上\N{\fs50}I tried, with Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:16.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,试什么？\N{\fs50}Tried what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我之前就知道他被感染了\N{\fs50}I knew he was infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:21.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我把我的血抹到了他的伤口上\N{\fs50}I rubbed some of my blood into his bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我懂 我懂 蠢死了\N{\fs50}I know, I know, it was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:24.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我\N{\fs50}But I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想救他\N{\fs50}I wanted to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我估计比这复杂得多\N{\fs50}Well, I reckon it's a lot more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:40.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳 她不是完人 但也不是傻瓜\N{\fs50}Marlene, she's a lotta things, but she's no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:43.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果她说他们能办到 那就能办到\N{\fs50}If she says they can do it, they can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:53.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想值第一班还是第二班？\N{\fs50}You wanna take first watch or second?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都我来吧\N{\fs50}I'll do both.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:58.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你好好睡吧\N{\fs50}Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:01.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,祝你梦到\N{\fs50}Dream of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:05.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,月亮上的绵羊牧场\N{\fs50}sheep ranches on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fs50}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你睡觉的时候还在说梦话\N{\fs50}Still mumbling in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我醒得早\N{\fs50}I woke up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你睡太死了 所以 我就值了第二班\N{\fs50}You were passed out, so I took second watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:34.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这种情况你应该叫醒我\N{\fs50}You gotta wake me up if that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:36.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不可以这样\N{\fs50}You can't do things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:37.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fs50}But I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:39.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚不就这么做了\N{\fs50}'Cause I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要对你负责 懂吗？\N{\fs50}I'm responsible for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你就别睡着\N{\fs50}Then don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:46.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没出声 我检查了身后\N{\fs50}I was quiet, I checked my six,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:49.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,察看有没有足迹 还找到了高地\N{\fs50}I looked for tracks, I found the high ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:50.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且我一直站着岗\N{\fs50}and I kept watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,按你教我的做\N{\fs50}Like you taught me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:55.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能说啥呢 老兄？我是天生好手\N{\fs50}What can I say, man? I'm a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下次你得叫醒我\N{\fs50}You wake me up next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:11.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fs50}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,死亡之河 还是没人\N{\fs50}The River of Death. Still no people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:31.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs50}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:32.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在学吹口哨\N{\fs50}I'm learning how to whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:33.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不会吹口哨？\N{\fs50}You don't know how to whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:35.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我听着像会吹口哨吗？\N{\fs50}Does it sound like I know how to whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:36.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不像\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:41.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 你他妈咋办到的？\N{\fs50}Seriously, though, how the fuck do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:42.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天赋\N{\fs50}Talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs50}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:44.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你应该教我打猎\N{\fs50}You should teach me how to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:46.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fs50}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:49.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“哈” 意思是 “她是个女孩儿 女孩儿就是不行”\N{\fs50}"Huh." Like, "She's a girl. She can't handle it."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你开枪没问题\N{\fs50}You can handle the shootin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但加工可能不太行\N{\fs50}Not so sure about the dressin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,加工是指什么？\N{\fs50}What's the dressin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:56.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是把内脏掏出来\N{\fs50}The part where you take the guts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:58.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哦 嗐\N{\fs50}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:59.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为啥叫加工啊？\N{\fs50}Why do they call it dressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得 你应该管这个叫减工\N{\fs50}It's like, you should call it undressing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为就是在减啊\N{\fs50}'cause it is. It's like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:06.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,减掉里边的东西\N{\fs50}undressing from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:10.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还是很有兴趣的哟\N{\fs50}Still interested, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:22.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大坝啊\N{\fs50}Dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你又不是威尔·莱文斯顿\N{\fs50}You're no Will Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:27.66,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs48}威尔·莱文斯顿是艾莉的冷笑话书的作者；“Dam”（大坝）谐音“Damn”（他妈的）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:27.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可不 没人能像他啊\N{\fs50}Yeah, yeah, but who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以这东西能做出电来？\N{\fs50}So that made electricity?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:30.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.62,0:14:33.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别问我怎么做到的 我不懂原理\N{\fs50}Don't ask me. I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:36.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你其实可以随便编两句\N{\fs50}You know, you could've just made something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:37.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会信你的\N{\fs50}I would've believed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:42.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快看那河 真够蓝的\N{\fs50}Look at that river. It's crazy blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:53.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 乔尔 如果这就是死亡之河呢？\N{\fs50}Hey, Joel, what if this is the River of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,站我身后\N{\fs50}Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不想找麻烦\N{\fs50}We ain't lookin' for any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:31.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们只是路过\N{\fs50}We're just passin' through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:32.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fs50}Drop the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fs50}You
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:48.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,后退五步\N{\fs50}take five steps back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们能不能先谈谈？\N{\fs50}How 'bout we just talk this through?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈能不能先把嘴闭上？\N{\fs50}How 'bout you shut the fuck up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 冷静\N{\fs50}Okay, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的\N{\fs50}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:03.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们接近过感染者吗？\N{\fs50}You been near Infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:04.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里没有感染者\N{\fs50}There's no Infected out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:05.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有个屁\N{\fs50}The hell there ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想挨枪子还来得及\N{\fs50}Last chance for a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:17.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是要感染了 他能闻出来 然后把你大卸八块\N{\fs50}If you've been infected, he will smell it and he will rip you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚说了 我们只想继续往前走\N{\fs50}Like I said, we'll just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:40.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在换她\N{\fs50}Now her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨！\N{\fs50}Hi. Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:14.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs50}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为自己多争取了十秒\N{\fs50}You just bought yourself 10 more seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们来这干什么？\N{\fs50}What are you doin' out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:29.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只是在找我弟弟\N{\fs50}I'm just lookin' for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,仅此而已 没别的\N{\fs50}That's all, nothin' more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:39.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fs50}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:42.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:00.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米！\N{\fs50}Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:31.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈在这儿干嘛？\N{\fs50}What the fuck you doin' here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是来救你的\N{\fs50}I came here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:56.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不够还有\N{\fs50}There's more if you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:57.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 女士\N{\fs50}Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:00.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们有一些日子没吃顿正经的了\N{\fs50}It's been a while since we've had a proper meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:02.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说真的 我感觉我从来就没吃上过正经的\N{\fs50}Actually, I don't think I've ever had a proper meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:03.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,太他妈好吃了\N{\fs50}This is fuckin' amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fs50}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:07.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要注意礼貌\N{\fs50}let's mind our manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:15.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:18.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你什么毛病？ - 她的礼貌呢？\N{\fs50}- What's wrong with you? - What about her manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:20.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她只是好奇\N{\fs50}She was just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:23.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里的孩子跟你的说话打扮都不大一样\N{\fs50}Kids around here don't usually look or talk like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:25.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 那也许我可以教教他们\N{\fs50}Right, well, maybe I'll teach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还想要回我的枪\N{\fs50}And I want my gun back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:31.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们也不持枪\N{\fs50}They also aren't armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:32.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 我说\N{\fs50}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:36.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想咱可能一上来有点误会\N{\fs50}I think maybe y'all got a little off on the wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:37.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她要让手下人杀了我们\N{\fs50}She was gonna have her guys kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.81,0:20:40.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们得谨慎挑选放进来的人\N{\fs50}Well, we gotta be real careful about who we let in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但都是虚张声势\N{\fs50}But it's all bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:43.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们只是想吓跑那些挑战我们的人\N{\fs50}We're just tryna scare off those who might wanna try us is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗬 你们可把外边一对九十来岁的\N{\fs50}Well, you got a couple of 90-year-olds
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:46.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 夫妇给吓尿裤子了 - 艾莉\N{\fs50}- shitting themselves out there. - Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:48.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们说你们遍地留尸？\N{\fs50}They say that you leave dead bodies around?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:49.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那些是想要挑战我们的人\N{\fs50}Those are the people who tried us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:52.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,名声不好不代表你人就不好\N{\fs50}A bad reputation doesn't mean you're bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:54.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,至少不总是\N{\fs50}Not always, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:20:59.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fs50}Ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们很感激你的盛情招待\N{\fs50}we're grateful for your hospitality and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:06.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我希望有个自家人单独相处的机会\N{\fs50}But it'd be nice to have a moment here, maybe just for family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:10.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fs50}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:14.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚也是自家人\N{\fs50}Maria is family, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！恭喜啊\N{\fs50}Oh, shit! Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:23.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 快说恭喜\N{\fs50}Joel, say congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:28.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fs50}Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:35.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 带你们参观下？ - 好\N{\fs50}- How 'bout a tour? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:38.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们大约七年前在此定居\N{\fs50}We settled here about seven years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:40.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当时只有我们几个人\N{\fs50}Just a handful of us back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:42.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那一片原本就是带大门的社区\N{\fs50}That section was already a gated community,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,于是我们从那儿开始建墙\N{\fs50}so we built the rest of the wall out from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:48.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,挡住了绝大部分打劫的 但仍然有些零散的\N{\fs50}Stopped most of the raiding parties, but we still find pockets of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:49.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感染者呢？\N{\fs50}And you said Infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:51.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也有 但通常是小股的\N{\fs50}Yeah, but usually smaller colonies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从城市那儿游荡过来的\N{\fs50}wandered off from the cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:54.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里地势这么开阔\N{\fs50}All this open country out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都是活靶子\N{\fs50}it's a turkey shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:59.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还是用那把雷明顿700步枪 但我找到了一个可变瞄准镜\N{\fs50}I still got my 700, but I found a variable power scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:00.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亚角分的精度\N{\fs50}Sub-MOA.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:02.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,半英里外都能打中它们的头\N{\fs50}Can headshot those fuckers from a half mile out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:03.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你能教我吗\N{\fs50}Can you teach me how?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 他不能\N{\fs50}No, he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:07.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么做到让这地方不露风声的？\N{\fs50}How do you keep this place quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,小心行事 身处僻远本身就有优势\N{\fs50}Carefully. Being in the middle of nowhere helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不到处说我们的情况 也不接收广播\N{\fs50}Not advertising what we have, staying off the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.99,0:22:14.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,礼拜堂 接纳多种信仰\N{\fs50}House of worship, multifaith.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.29,0:22:17.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,学校 洗衣房\N{\fs50}School. Laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.04,0:22:19.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,旧银行当监狱用了 但我们也用不着\N{\fs50}Old bank works as the jail, not that we've needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:21.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们的电是从大坝弄来的？\N{\fs50}And you draw power from the dam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,几年前弄好的\N{\fs50}Got that workin' a couple years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弄好之后 下水道 水管 热水器 全都有了\N{\fs50}After that, sewage, plumbing, water heaters,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:27.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有光\N{\fs50}lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:29.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这地方还真他妈运转得起来\N{\fs50}This place actually fuckin' works.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:34.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 乔尔 快看\N{\fs50}Hey, Joel, check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:41.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 你 算是老大？\N{\fs50}So are you, like, in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:43.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有谁是老大\N{\fs50}No one person's in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:44.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是议会的一员\N{\fs50}I'm on the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:46.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,议会是民主选举的\N{\fs50}Democratically elected,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:48.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,服务大约三百人 包括儿童\N{\fs50}serving 300 people, including children.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.57,0:22:49.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有人都得参与\N{\fs50}Everyone pitches in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:51.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们轮班巡逻 准备食物 维修\N{\fs50}We rotate patrols, food prep, repairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,捕猎 收割作物\N{\fs50}hunting, harvesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.33,0:22:55.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在我们镇子里看到的一切\N{\fs50}Everything you see in our town,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:58.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,温室 牲畜 都是共享的\N{\fs50}greenhouses, livestock, all shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:22:59.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,集体所有制\N{\fs50}Collective ownership.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:02.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就是共产主义\N{\fs50}So, communism.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:04.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不是那回事儿\N{\fs50}Nah. Nah, it ain't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:06.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事儿\N{\fs50}It is that. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.21,0:23:07.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是一个公社 我们是共产主义者\N{\fs50}This is a commune. We're communists.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:11.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是吧！\N{\fs50}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:12.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我们最年轻的一匹\N{\fs50}That's our newest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:14.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,才几个月大 你想摸摸她吗？\N{\fs50}Couple months old. You wanna pet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.39,0:23:15.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊 她叫什么？\N{\fs50}Yeah, what's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:16.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,微光\N{\fs50}Shimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:18.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,微光 你可真漂亮\N{\fs50}Shimmer. You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:20.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想他们肯定想洗个澡 换上些新衣服\N{\fs50}Well, I'm sure they'd like a shower, some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:22.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可以让他们住在咱们街对面的空屋里\N{\fs50}We can put them in the empty house cross the street from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.81,0:23:24.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 那地方不错\N{\fs50}Yeah. It's a decent place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:27.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,03年以后基本没人动过 但里边有暖气\N{\fs50}Pretty much untouched since '03, but it's got the heat goin' in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:28.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有比这差的\N{\fs50}Could do worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:30.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,相信我 我们经历不少了\N{\fs50}Trust me, we have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:32.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们好得很\N{\fs50}We've been doin' fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:39.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我带艾莉去瞧瞧 你俩也好叙叙旧？\N{\fs50}Well, I'll take Ellie over there if you two wanna catch up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.46,0:23:42.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 好啊\N{\fs50}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:45.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:46.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放宽心\N{\fs50}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:49.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们走吧？\N{\fs50}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:23:58.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好久不见了\N{\fs50}Been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:05.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看着没怎么老啊\N{\fs50}Doesn't seem like you aged much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.65,0:24:06.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你倒是老了不少\N{\fs50}You, on the other hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.03,0:24:14.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你还在乎我\N{\fs50}Thanks for still givin' a shit about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我正使劲养猪呢\N{\fs50}Workin' on raisin' some hogs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:27.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说 一旦有了培根 还要啥呢？\N{\fs50}Once we get bacon, I mean, what's even left?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.75,0:24:31.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,圣诞树和培根？\N{\fs50}Christmas trees and bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.59,0:24:33.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过得挺不错啊\N{\fs50}Pretty decent setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:36.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 泰丝怎样？\N{\fs50}So how's Tess?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.05,0:24:39.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她挺好\N{\fs50}She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.43,0:24:40.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还行\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.41,0:24:41.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fs50}Good then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那孩子呢？\N{\fs50}And the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:47.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 对了\N{\fs50}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:51.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她是火萤某个大人物的女儿\N{\fs50}She's the daughter of some Firefly muckety-muck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:54.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想要在这边找到她的家人\N{\fs50}Tryna find her family somewhere out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.07,0:24:56.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚好也顺路 所以就\N{\fs50}I was headin' in this direction, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.97,0:24:57.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fs50}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.49,0:24:59.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是出自好心？\N{\fs50}Goodness of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.58,0:25:01.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有报酬\N{\fs50}There's a payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.66,0:25:07.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你知道他们可能在哪儿吗？火萤的人？\N{\fs50}So you know where they might be? These Fireflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.33,0:25:10.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呃 他们在东科罗拉多大学有个基地\N{\fs50}Well, they got a base down at the University of Eastern Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.42,0:25:13.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,往南一周的骑程\N{\fs50}It's a week's ride south.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:17.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但路上的情况挺操蛋的\N{\fs50}But it is severely fucked up between here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.30,0:25:20.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感染者 打劫的\N{\fs50}Infected, raiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:22.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走一趟并不轻松\N{\fs50}It's not exactly an easy trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.43,0:25:25.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对咱们来说挺轻松的 毕竟你半英里外就能\N{\fs50}It'll be easy for us, seeing as how you can headshot Infected
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.19,0:25:26.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,打中感染者的脑袋\N{\fs50}from half a mile away,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.35,0:25:28.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,顺带一提 真他妈能扯\N{\fs50}which is a bunch of bullshit, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我去不了 - 得了吧\N{\fs50}- Yeah, I can't go. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.19,0:25:33.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都横跨全国了\N{\fs50}I made it across the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.65,0:25:35.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱俩可以从这儿再跨到科罗拉多\N{\fs50}The two of us can make it from here to Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.70,0:25:41.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么 你老婆不让？\N{\fs50}What, 'cause your wife won't let you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.99,0:25:44.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 乔尔 - 是她不让你接收广播的？\N{\fs50}- Joel. - She the one who kept you off the radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.54,0:25:46.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你才不回我消息？\N{\fs50}Is that why you stopped messaging me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:49.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在我退出了火萤以后 玛丽亚和她的人遇到了我\N{\fs50}After I ditched the Fireflies, Maria and her crew found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.21,0:25:51.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们是好人\N{\fs50}They're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:54.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们本可以不管我 但还是收留了我\N{\fs50}They didn't have to take me in, but they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:56.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,唯一的要求就是我遵守他们的规矩\N{\fs50}And all they ask is that I follow their rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.01,0:25:57.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是你哥哥\N{\fs50}I'm your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.03,0:25:58.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 我没忘\N{\fs50}Yeah, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:02.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们对这个地方保护得很上心\N{\fs50}They're very protective of this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:03.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且理由很他妈的充分\N{\fs50}and for good fuckin' reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:04.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要有人知道了我们在这——\N{\fs50}Folks find out we're up here--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:06.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我听见了\N{\fs50}No, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.35,0:26:08.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不该来的人可能会出现\N{\fs50}Wrong people might show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:11.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我是吗？我是不该来的人吗？\N{\fs50}So is that what I am? Am I the wrong people?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.11,0:26:12.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 乔尔——  - 我做的那些事 汤米\N{\fs50}- Joel-- - Those things I did, Tommy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:14.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你拿来评判我的那些事\N{\fs50}those things that you judge me for,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.61,0:26:16.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做这些事是为了让我们活下来\N{\fs50}I did those things to keep us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.19,0:26:17.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一起做的\N{\fs50}We did those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.65,0:26:19.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且那些不是“事”\N{\fs50}And they weren't "things."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:21.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们杀了人\N{\fs50}We murdered people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:23.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会因此评判你\N{\fs50}And I don't judge you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.91,0:26:27.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当时我们只知道这种活法\N{\fs50}We survived the only way we knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.08,0:26:29.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但有别的活法\N{\fs50}But there were other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是当时我们不擅长罢了\N{\fs50}We just weren't any good at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.21,0:26:33.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要知道了我这一路吃的苦头\N{\fs50}If you knew the shit that I've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.75,0:26:35.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 几个月以来就是为了找你——\N{\fs50}Tommy, tryin' to find you these last few months--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.63,0:26:37.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就要当爸爸了\N{\fs50}I'm gonna be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:40.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚已经怀孕几个月了\N{\fs50}Maria's a few months along now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:44.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我必须更小心\N{\fs50}So I just gotta be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.69,0:26:51.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老实说 我吓得要死\N{\fs50}To be honest, I'm scared to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:58.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我也说不好 我觉得我会是一个好爸爸\N{\fs50}But I don't know. I feel like I'd be a good dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.49,0:27:06.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到时候就知道了\N{\fs50}Guess we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.75,0:27:11.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“到时候就知道了？”\N{\fs50}"I guess we'll find out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:12.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就这句话？\N{\fs50}That's all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.86,0:27:14.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还有啥好说的？\N{\fs50}What else am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.47,0:27:21.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就算你的人生停下了\N{\fs50}Just because life stopped for you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.05,0:27:25.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也不代表我就要跟着停下\N{\fs50}doesn't mean it has to stop for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:35.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们补充点物资 明早就不再烦你了\N{\fs50}We'll grab some supplies and be outta your hair in the mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:50.33,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 走在屋顶上 叮 叮 叮 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Up on the house top, click, click, click ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.33,0:27:53.42,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 圣诞老人从烟囱下来 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Down through the chimney with good St. Nick ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.42,0:27:56.38,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 驯鹿在屋顶上停下来 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Up on the housetop reindeer paws ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.38,0:27:58.76,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 一蹦蹦出个圣诞老人 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Out jumps good old Santa Claus ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.76,0:28:02.76,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 从烟囱下来 带着好多礼物 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Down through the chimney with lots of toys ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:06.10,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 全都给孩子 圣诞多喜乐 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ All for the little ones, Christmas joys ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.10,0:28:09.14,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 吼 吼 吼 谁还不肯走 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Ho, ho, ho, who wouldn't go ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.14,0:28:11.73,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 吼 吼 吼 谁还不肯走 噢 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Ho, ho, ho, who wouldn't go, oh ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:15.11,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 走在屋顶上 叮 叮 叮 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Up on the house top, click, click, click ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.11,0:28:17.73,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 圣诞老人从烟囱下来 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Down through the chimney with good St. Nick ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.68,0:29:26.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好恶心\N{\fs50}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.87,0:29:54.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哈喽？\N{\fs50}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.21,0:30:04.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚？\N{\fs50}Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.21,0:30:40.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,正好你来了\N{\fs50}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.29,0:30:43.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,刚交易来的 来 快换上\N{\fs50}Just traded for this. Go ahead, try it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:52.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真他妈的紫啊\N{\fs50}It's super fuckin' purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 茄子色 合身吗？ - 嗯\N{\fs50}- Eggplant. It fits? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:57.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 鞋子不会大了吧？ - 不会\N{\fs50}- Shoes aren't too big? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.02,0:30:59.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我的衣服呢？- 拿去当抹布了\N{\fs50}- Where's my other stuff? - Rag pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.39,0:31:01.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我留给你的东西拿到了吗？ - 拿到了\N{\fs50}- Did you get the thing I left you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:03.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好怪的礼物 - 但很有用\N{\fs50}- Weirdest gift ever. - But useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.11,0:31:05.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 谁给你剪的头发？ - 世界级的沙龙\N{\fs50}- Who's been cutting your hair? - World-class salons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.25,0:31:07.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,世界级的理发沙龙\N{\fs50}World-class salons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:09.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等我拿剪刀来\N{\fs50}Let me get my scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.65,0:31:11.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我才不要——  - 修一修而已\N{\fs50}- I will not-- - Trim. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.32,0:31:13.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就修发梢 我保证\N{\fs50}Just the ends, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.79,0:31:19.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 这是你以前的工作吗？\N{\fs50}So, this was, like, your job back then or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:24.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 我以前是内布拉斯加州奥马哈的地区助理检察官\N{\fs50}No, I was an Assistant District Attorney out of Omaha, Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.09,0:31:27.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我抓坏人坐牢\N{\fs50}I put bad guys in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.67,0:31:29.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,挺酷的 我猜\N{\fs50}Cool, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.84,0:31:33.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我一直都很喜欢弄头发 也许做母亲的就会这样\N{\fs50}I always liked doing hair, though. Maybe it was a mom thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.72,0:31:36.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你刚在看汤米做的小纪念牌？\N{\fs50}You were looking at the little memorial Tommy made?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:38.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.73,0:31:42.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很遗憾你失去了两个孩子\N{\fs50}I'm sorry about your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:43.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fs50}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.56,0:31:45.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只有一个 只有凯文\N{\fs50}And kid. Just Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.94,0:31:47.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莎拉是乔尔的女儿\N{\fs50}Sarah was Joel's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.78,0:31:54.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许我不该说的\N{\fs50}Maybe I shouldn't have said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.35,0:31:56.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 没关系\N{\fs50}No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.49,0:32:00.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜这多少也解释了他的性子\N{\fs50}I guess that explains him a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:02.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 我不会问你和他一起做什么\N{\fs50}Look, I'm not gonna ask you what you're doing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.67,0:32:03.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.63,0:32:05.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但乔尔身上有些事你明显不了解\N{\fs50}But there are clearly things you don't know about Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.54,0:32:08.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你指的是他以前杀人？这我知道\N{\fs50}Like how he used to kill people? I know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.88,0:32:12.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你就明白为什么担心了\N{\fs50}So then you understand my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:13.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他不这么干了\N{\fs50}He doesn't do that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:14.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他不再杀人了？\N{\fs50}He stopped killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.82,0:32:15.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不杀无辜的\N{\fs50}Innocent ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且汤米也干过 你担心他吗？\N{\fs50}And Tommy did it, too. Are you worried about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:23.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米当时只是跟随乔尔\N{\fs50}Tommy was following Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.31,0:32:24.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就像你现在这样\N{\fs50}The way you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.42,0:32:26.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 也许我比汤米要聪明\N{\fs50}Well, maybe I'm smarter than Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fs50}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.52,0:32:29.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你确实很聪明\N{\fs50}You are definitely smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:32.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,肯定能成个好律师\N{\fs50}Would've made a hell of a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.78,0:32:35.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很多事你都没和我说\N{\fs50}There's a whole lot you're not telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.16,0:32:38.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.16,0:32:40.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是重点\N{\fs50}Therein lies the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.83,0:32:43.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谨慎挑选你信任的人\N{\fs50}Be careful who you put your faith in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.62,0:32:48.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只有我们信任的人 才会背叛我们\N{\fs50}The only people who can betray us, are the ones we trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.21,0:32:52.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fs50}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.64,0:32:56.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fs50}Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.51,0:32:58.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拿上你的超级无敌茄子外套\N{\fs50}Grab your super fuckin' eggplant coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.93,0:32:59.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.20,0:33:01.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,电影院\N{\fs50}The movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:08.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是艾略特·加菲尔德 我刚住进另一个房间\N{\fs50}Elliot Garfield. I'm moving into the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:11.60,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,电影《再见女郎》（The Goodbye Girl），上映于1977年
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.57,0:33:12.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我是托尼的朋友 你认识的 托尼·德福雷斯特\N{\fs50}Yeah. I'm a friend of Tony's, you know, Tony DeForrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.24,0:33:15.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那挺好的\N{\fs50}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.11,0:33:17.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也是演员\N{\fs50}I'm an actor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.20,0:33:19.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fs50}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.45,0:33:21.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你妈妈认识我\N{\fs50}Well, your mother knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.45,0:33:22.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fs50}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:25.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那\N{\fs50}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:28.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们之后见了\N{\fs50}guess I'll be seeing you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.84,0:33:29.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,之后见\N{\fs50}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.57,0:33:31.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fs50}Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.59,0:33:36.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,刚见了露西\N{\fs50}Just met Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.13,0:33:37.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你和她说了什么？\N{\fs50}What did you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.64,0:33:39.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说我搬进了另一个房间\N{\fs50}That I was moving into the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.01,0:33:40.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她好像坦然接受了\N{\fs50}She seemed to take it in stride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.24,0:33:59.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们说我也许能在这儿找到你\N{\fs50}The guys said I might find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.29,0:34:05.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,应该能帮你把麻烦省了\N{\fs50}Figured I'd save you the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.42,0:34:16.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不该说那些话的\N{\fs50}I shouldn't have said what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.76,0:34:19.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我其实根本不是那么想的\N{\fs50}I don't even believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.14,0:34:23.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道你为我高兴 但——\N{\fs50}I know you're happy for me. It just--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.85,0:34:26.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这对你来说很复杂\N{\fs50}It's complicated for you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:28.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.98,0:34:33.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你要不要放我一马？\N{\fs50}So you gonna let me off the hook, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.57,0:34:36.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,骑马去那所大学 这是自杀任务吗？\N{\fs50}This ride to the University, is it a suicide mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:38.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:40.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,路上是有危险 但你能应付得来\N{\fs50}It's dangerous, but it's nothin' you can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.95,0:34:42.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只要做好准备 做你擅长的就行\N{\fs50}Just prepare and do what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.28,0:34:44.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去过那儿的人 有能回来的吗？\N{\fs50}You've had people go that way and come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:45.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,全都回来了\N{\fs50}All of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.66,0:34:47.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到底咋回事？\N{\fs50}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.21,0:34:52.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她是免疫的\N{\fs50}She's immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.50,0:34:55.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.82,0:34:56.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.22,0:34:59.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她被感染了 但她没生病\N{\fs50}She got infected but she didn't get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.97,0:35:00.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米\N{\fs50}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.93,0:35:05.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 我亲眼看着她被咬\N{\fs50}Tommy, I saw her get bit myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.01,0:35:07.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是几个月前了 几个月\N{\fs50}That was months ago. Months.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.06,0:35:09.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她是免疫的\N{\fs50}She's immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.33,0:35:30.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从头开始讲\N{\fs50}From the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:36.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一开始是玛琳\N{\fs50}It was Marlene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.96,0:35:39.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她雇我们偷运她 送到火萤那儿\N{\fs50}She hired us to smuggle her to some Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.38,0:35:41.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但出了岔子\N{\fs50}It went bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.51,0:35:43.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝被咬了\N{\fs50}Tess got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.26,0:35:47.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她要我发誓把这孩子带走\N{\fs50}She made me swear to take the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.81,0:35:49.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是她的遗愿\N{\fs50}It was her dyin' wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.89,0:35:51.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈还能怎样？\N{\fs50}What the hell was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:56.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们走到了堪萨斯城 然后——\N{\fs50}We made it as far as K.C., and then--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:35:59.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 在那儿她救了我的命\N{\fs50}You know, she saved my life there
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:01.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从另一个孩子手上\N{\fs50}from another kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.53,0:36:04.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要是五年前 我轻而易举就能灭了他\N{\fs50}Five years ago, I would've destroyed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.37,0:36:07.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但她不得不向他开枪来救我的命\N{\fs50}But she had to shoot him to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.99,0:36:09.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她才十四岁\N{\fs50}Fourteen years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.20,0:36:14.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就因为我动作太慢 耳朵跟他妈聋了一样 没听见他过来\N{\fs50}Because I was too slow and too fuckin' deaf to hear him comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我看见\N{\fs50}And I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:22.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看见一个人为了救她\N{\fs50}I saw a man kill his own brother
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.89,0:36:26.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,杀了他自己的兄弟 而我只能看着\N{\fs50}to save her, while I just watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.51,0:36:29.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今天 我以为那只狗要把她大卸大块\N{\fs50}And today, I thought that dog was gonna tear her apart
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.31,0:36:31.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为它会在她身上闻出来\N{\fs50}because it smelled somethin' on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:33.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我只是站在那里\N{\fs50}And all I did was stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.94,0:36:37.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,动不了\N{\fs50}I couldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.98,0:36:39.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想不到说什么 我只是——\N{\fs50}I couldn't think of anything to say. I just--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.86,0:36:44.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很害怕\N{\fs50}I was so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.20,0:36:50.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你以为我还能像过去那样\N{\fs50}You think I can still handle things but
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:52.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我不是过去的我了\N{\fs50}I'm not who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.12,0:36:55.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很软弱\N{\fs50}I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.00,0:36:57.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,最近 我感觉有些时候\N{\fs50}Lately, there are these moments
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.29,0:36:59.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,恐惧突然涌上来 然后\N{\fs50}where the fear comes up outta nowhere and
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.50,0:37:01.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的心脏\N{\fs50}my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:04.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,似乎不跳了\N{\fs50}feels like it's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.35,0:37:10.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还会做梦\N{\fs50}And I have dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.31,0:37:14.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,每晚都是\N{\fs50}Every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.06,0:37:16.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么样的梦？\N{\fs50}What kinda dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.10,0:37:20.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不记得了\N{\fs50}I don't know. I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.53,0:37:23.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只知道每当我醒来\N{\fs50}I just know that when I wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.82,0:37:28.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我失去了什么\N{\fs50}I've lost somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.83,0:37:31.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在梦中都会失败\N{\fs50}I'm failin' in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:34.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只会这样\N{\fs50}That's all I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.41,0:37:37.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做的只有这些\N{\fs50}It's all I've ever done
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:38.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,辜负她\N{\fs50}is fail her
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.42,0:37:40.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一次又一次\N{\fs50}again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:43.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想让我带上她\N{\fs50}You want me to take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.71,0:37:45.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只会害死她\N{\fs50}I'm just gonna get her killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.97,0:37:47.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fs50}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.05,0:37:49.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我必须离开她\N{\fs50}I have to leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.39,0:37:52.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.93,0:37:55.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是你离开我的原因 对吧？\N{\fs50}It's why you took off on me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.35,0:37:57.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,补偿我们以前做的那些事？\N{\fs50}To make up for the things we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.81,0:38:03.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在机会来了 它能让你的孩子活在一个更好的世界里\N{\fs50}Well, here's your chance to bring your kid into a better world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.69,0:38:05.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你比我年轻 你还很强壮\N{\fs50}You're younger than me. You're still strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.44,0:38:07.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你自己说的 你能回来\N{\fs50}You said it yourself, you'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.66,0:38:09.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你必须带上她\N{\fs50}You have to take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.87,0:38:18.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且你不能告诉任何人 玛丽亚也不行\N{\fs50}And you can't tell anyone, not even Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.38,0:38:21.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,汤米 我只信任你\N{\fs50}Tommy, you're the only one I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.75,0:38:25.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果有任何人看到了她的伤口 她皮肤下边的东西\N{\fs50}If anyone else sees those bites on her, what's under her skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.51,0:38:27.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们会杀了她的\N{\fs50}they'll shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.55,0:38:32.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我求你做的最后一件事\N{\fs50}It's the last thing I'll ever ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.27,0:38:35.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.86,0:38:51.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明早带她走\N{\fs50}I'll take her out at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.92,0:39:09.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们把你安排在38号房子 往左拐 左拐 再往右\N{\fs50}We got you in 38. It's left, left, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.98,0:39:25.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我感觉你更想一个人待着 露丝\N{\fs50}I have a feeling you'd rather be alone, Luce.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:28.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要是不打招呼 他会知道我们觉得戏很烂的\N{\fs50}He'll know we thought it was lousy if we don't say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.24,0:39:30.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 但说话圆滑点\N{\fs50}All right. But try to be tactful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.20,0:39:32.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 什么是圆滑？ - 说假话\N{\fs50}-What's tactful? -Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.28,0:39:36.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哈喽？\N{\fs50}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.70,0:39:39.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,加菲尔德先生？是露西和我\N{\fs50}Mr. Garfield? It's Lucy and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.79,0:39:45.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们回来是想告诉你 我们有多喜欢这部戏\N{\fs50}We just came back to tell you how much we enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.04,0:39:46.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看得可开心了\N{\fs50}I had the best time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.67,0:39:48.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一开始我还以为会很无聊\N{\fs50}At first, I thought it was gonna be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:08.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:21.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,以前她们真只需要担心这些吗？\N{\fs50}Is this really all they had to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.16,0:40:24.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,男孩子 电影\N{\fs50}Boys. Movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.96,0:40:27.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,决定哪件衬衫搭哪件外套\N{\fs50}Deciding which shirt goes with which skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.84,0:40:30.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fs50}It's bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:35.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 听着 - 你为什么在这儿？\N{\fs50}- Listen, - Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.35,0:40:38.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有话和你说\N{\fs50}I came here to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.45,0:40:40.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 你为什么还在这儿？\N{\fs50}No, why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.14,0:40:42.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要抛弃我 那就抛弃吧\N{\fs50}If you're gonna ditch me, ditch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.81,0:40:46.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你究竟听到了什么？\N{\fs50}What exactly did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:50.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我必须离开她 你必须带上她”\N{\fs50}"I have to leave her. You have to take her."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.91,0:40:57.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我今天还帮你说话来着 因为我以为——\N{\fs50}You know, I stood up for you today because I thought--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.58,0:41:05.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我这么决定是为你好\N{\fs50}I made this decision for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.54,0:41:07.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你和汤米一起走更好\N{\fs50}You'll be way better off with Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.59,0:41:10.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他比我更了解这一带——\N{\fs50}He knows the area better than I do--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.05,0:41:11.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你到底在不在乎我？\N{\fs50}Do you give a shit about me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.82,0:41:12.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我当然在乎\N{\fs50}Of course, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.26,0:41:14.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你到底在怕什么？\N{\fs50}Then what are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:20.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不是她 你知道吗\N{\fs50}I'm not her, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.14,0:41:24.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚跟我讲了莎拉的事——\N{\fs50}Maria told me about Sarah and--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:25.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fs50}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:31.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别再多说一个字\N{\fs50}Don't say another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:37.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉你失去了女儿 乔尔\N{\fs50}I'm sorry about your daughter, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.53,0:41:40.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我也失去过别人\N{\fs50}But I have lost people, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.12,0:41:43.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你根本不懂什么叫失去\N{\fs50}You have no idea what loss is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.12,0:41:47.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有我在乎过的人\N{\fs50}Everybody I have cared for
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.29,0:41:49.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要么死了 要么抛弃了我\N{\fs50}has either died or left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.46,0:41:53.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有人 就他妈除了你！\N{\fs50}Everybody, fucking except for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.13,0:41:55.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以别跟我说什么和别人一起更安全\N{\fs50}So don't tell me that I'd be safer with somebody else
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.47,0:41:58.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为说真的 那样我只会更害怕\N{\fs50}because the truth is I would just be more scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.19,0:42:07.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fs50}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.77,0:42:10.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不是我女儿\N{\fs50}You're not my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.11,0:42:13.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我也绝对不是你父亲\N{\fs50}And I sure as hell ain't your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.36,0:42:16.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到了早上\N{\fs50}Now, come dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.03,0:42:20.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们各走各的\N{\fs50}we're goin' our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.63,0:43:55.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fs50}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.98,0:44:18.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去马厩\N{\fs50}Stables.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.84,0:44:44.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是来告别的？\N{\fs50}You came here to say goodbye or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.30,0:44:45.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.14,0:44:48.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我来是偷一匹马然后走人\N{\fs50}I came here to steal one of these horses and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.89,0:44:49.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以给你一匹\N{\fs50}I woulda gave you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.47,0:44:51.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fs50}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:53.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fs50}Anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.98,0:44:56.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是半小时以前了 而我觉得\N{\fs50}that was 30 minutes ago, and I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.61,0:45:00.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你应该有得选\N{\fs50}you deserve a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.82,0:45:02.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还是觉得你和汤米走更好——\N{\fs50}I still think you'd be better off with Tommy--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.32,0:45:03.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs50}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.45,0:45:05.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那行\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.84,0:45:26.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,两只手一起抓\N{\fs50}Hold onto both.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.39,0:45:31.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,指个大概方向？\N{\fs50}General direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.77,0:45:34.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,朝东南边走 直到25号州际公路\N{\fs50}Head southeast till you hit I-25.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.69,0:45:37.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那所大学就在州际公路边上 应该不难找到\N{\fs50}It's right off the interstate. Shouldn't be hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.41,0:45:56.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里欢迎你 欢迎你俩\N{\fs50}There's a place for you here. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.08,0:45:58.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,正有此意\N{\fs50}Countin' on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.21,0:46:04.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那个能借给我吗？\N{\fs50}Can I borrow that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.59,0:46:06.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.51,0:46:08.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为玛丽亚拿走了我的 你明白吧？\N{\fs50}'Cause Maria took mine, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.26,0:46:10.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都已经说了 乔尔\N{\fs50}I already said yes, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:19.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,慢走 哥哥\N{\fs50}Adios, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.58,0:46:35.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,关门吧\N{\fs50}Close it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.35,0:47:01.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,偏右了\N{\fs50}Wide right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.27,0:47:03.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你手抖了 - 目标太小了\N{\fs50}- You're flinchin'. - The target's too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.40,0:47:05.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经做得偏大了 退弹匣\N{\fs50}I made it bigger than I should've. Eject the cartridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.19,0:47:08.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有我手没抖\N{\fs50}And I am not flinching.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:10.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这枪太烂了\N{\fs50}The rifle just sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.93,0:47:11.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好 给我\N{\fs50}Okay, give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.41,0:47:14.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它瞄不准\N{\fs50}It doesn't aim right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.74,0:47:15.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你试试就知道了\N{\fs50}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.37,0:47:19.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,深吸气 慢呼气\N{\fs50}A deep breath in, slow breath out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:21.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要带着爱意去扣扳机\N{\fs50}You squeeze the trigger like you love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.79,0:47:22.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,轻轻地\N{\fs50}Gentle,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:25.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,稳定住 慢慢来\N{\fs50}steady, nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.38,0:47:26.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是要开枪还是要让枪怀孕？\N{\fs50}You gonna shoot this thing or get it pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.92,0:47:31.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没用的 根本瞄不准\N{\fs50}It isn't gonna work. It doesn't aim right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.47,0:47:35.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你个混账\N{\fs50}You dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.41,0:48:02.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在杰克逊这套 以前的社会就是这样的？\N{\fs50}So the way they ran stuff in Jackson, was how things used to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.29,0:48:03.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.67,0:48:06.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个国家太大了 那套不管用\N{\fs50}The country was too big for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:09.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在以前 看待事物的方式主要是两种\N{\fs50}Back then, there were basically two main ways of lookin' at things.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.05,0:48:11.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有的人想拥有一切\N{\fs50}Some people wanted to own everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.26,0:48:15.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而有的人不希望任何人拥有任何东西\N{\fs50}And some people didn't want anyone to own anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.18,0:48:17.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是哪种？\N{\fs50}Which one were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:19.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都不是 我干好我的活儿\N{\fs50}Neither. I just did my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.27,0:48:22.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的活儿是盖房子？\N{\fs50}Which was building?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.35,0:48:23.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.94,0:48:26.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,房子 商店 之类的\N{\fs50}Houses, stores, that kinda thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:28.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们被称为“承包人”\N{\fs50}We were called "contractors."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.24,0:48:32.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“承包人”\N{\fs50}"The Contractor."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.24,0:48:34.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还挺酷的\N{\fs50}That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.32,0:48:37.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们挺酷的\N{\fs50}Yeah. We were cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.29,0:48:39.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有人都爱承包人\N{\fs50}Everybody loved contractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.62,0:48:41.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fs50}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.80,0:48:55.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你搞砸了你的第四次进攻\N{\fs50}Okay, so if you mess up your fourth down,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.97,0:48:57.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就得把球给另外一队？\N{\fs50}then you give the ball to the other team?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.01,0:48:59.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 这叫作“攻守交换”\N{\fs50}Right. It's called a "turnover."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.77,0:49:00.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,攻守交换\N{\fs50}Turnover.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.73,0:49:04.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但如果你推进到十码\N{\fs50}But if you make it to 10 yards,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.39,0:49:06.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就又回到首攻了？\N{\fs50}then you're back to first down?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.36,0:49:07.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fs50}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.07,0:49:12.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 基本上就是朝着一个方向推\N{\fs50}So, basically just moving in one direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.28,0:49:13.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,基本上是\N{\fs50}Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.28,0:49:17.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 但很暴力 - 嗯 还好有这个\N{\fs50}- But violent. - Oh. Well. There's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.12,0:49:22.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么样？五天就到了\N{\fs50}Well, how 'bout that? Made it in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.08,0:49:25.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,轻松得很 我不知道汤米在怕个啥\N{\fs50}Easy days. I don't know what Tommy was so afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.71,0:49:27.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走着看吧\N{\fs50}Still time to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.67,0:49:29.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“走着看吧”\N{\fs50}"Still time to find out."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.09,0:49:33.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“承包人人人”\N{\fs50}"The Contractorrrr."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.06,0:49:49.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大角羊主场 这是啥意思\N{\fs50}Home of the Big Horns. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.44,0:49:50.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,球队吉祥物\N{\fs50}Team mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:52.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是某种绵羊\N{\fs50}It's a kind of sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.94,0:49:54.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧？\N{\fs50}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.15,0:49:56.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,离你的梦想又进一步了\N{\fs50}One step closer to your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.82,0:49:58.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但没见着火萤的人\N{\fs50}Don't see any Fireflies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:50:00.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们也许在中间\N{\fs50}They're probably in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.12,0:50:01.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那边更安全\N{\fs50}Safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.04,0:50:05.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fs50}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:16.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以这地方\N{\fs50}So these places
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.09,0:50:18.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人们住在这儿 然后怎样？\N{\fs50}people would live here and, like, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.80,0:50:20.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 去上课啥的？ - 没错\N{\fs50}- Go to classes and stuff? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.85,0:50:22.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但他们都是大人了\N{\fs50}Even though they were adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.79,0:50:24.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不完全算是\N{\fs50}Sort of adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.10,0:50:26.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想在大学里整日玩乐\N{\fs50}I think it was just as much about partying
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.69,0:50:28.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和寻找自我一样重要\N{\fs50}and findin' themselves as anythin' else.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.94,0:50:31.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,搞清楚他们这辈子想做什么\N{\fs50}Figuring out what they wanted to do with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.31,0:50:33.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这辈子想做什么\N{\fs50}What they wanted to do with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.86,0:50:37.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我一直在想\N{\fs50}So I've been thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.45,0:50:39.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实我不想要绵羊牧场\N{\fs50}I don't want a sheep ranch, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.78,0:50:41.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 条件还是我想做什么都行 对吧？\N{\fs50}I mean, if the deal is I can do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.16,0:50:42.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.74,0:50:44.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那\N{\fs50}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.16,0:50:46.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,小时候 我想当歌手\N{\fs50}when I was a kid, I wanted to be a singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:47.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,扯吧你\N{\fs50}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:50.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有啥好笑的？\N{\fs50}Why is that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.92,0:50:52.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你这下得唱首歌了\N{\fs50}You gotta sing something now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.57,0:50:53.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.09,0:50:54.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别嘛 老兄 我不会笑你的\N{\fs50}Come on, man. I'm not gonna laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.53,0:50:55.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你已经在笑了\N{\fs50}You're already laughin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.38,0:50:56.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这倒没错\N{\fs50}Yeah, okay, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.59,0:50:59.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你之后要给我唱\N{\fs50}Well, you're singin' for me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.76,0:51:01.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都他妈的要拯救世界了 老兄\N{\fs50}I'm gonna save the fuckin' world, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.32,0:51:03.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你给我唱首歌不为过吧\N{\fs50}It's the least you can do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.14,0:51:06.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有道理\N{\fs50}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.65,0:51:13.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那些是猴子吗？\N{\fs50}Are those monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.48,0:51:15.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,肯定是从旧实验室逃出来的\N{\fs50}Must be from the old labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.82,0:51:18.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看它们跑的样子\N{\fs50}Look at them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.36,0:51:19.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第一次看见猴子？\N{\fs50}First time seein' a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.99,0:51:21.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第一次看见猴子\N{\fs50}First time seein' a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.58,0:51:27.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fs50}Lookit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:34.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就到了\N{\fs50}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.84,0:51:39.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,警卫站\N{\fs50}Guard stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.86,0:51:41.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有警卫\N{\fs50}No guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.26,0:51:45.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.39,0:51:46.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备枪？\N{\fs50}Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.02,0:51:49.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.75,0:52:54.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里以前肯定有医生\N{\fs50}There were definitely doctors here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.34,0:53:05.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是份打包清单\N{\fs50}This is a packing list.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.34,0:53:08.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走人之前会列这个\N{\fs50}Somethin' you make before moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.51,0:53:09.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们就这么走了？\N{\fs50}They just left?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.27,0:53:14.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许没全走\N{\fs50}Maybe not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.94,0:54:04.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还好 至少不是循声者\N{\fs50}Well, at least it ain't Clickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.65,0:54:06.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 但也不是火萤\N{\fs50}Yeah, no Fireflies either.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.49,0:54:10.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许在这么多实验以后 他们变成他妈的猴子了\N{\fs50}Maybe in all that research, they turned into fuckin' monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.88,0:54:29.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们去了这儿？\N{\fs50}That's where they went?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.43,0:54:31.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有针脚都指向这里\N{\fs50}All the pins lead there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.30,0:54:33.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许是听到了风声\N{\fs50}Maybe gettin' ahead of the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.26,0:54:34.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或许那边设施更好？\N{\fs50}better facilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.64,0:54:35.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也不清楚\N{\fs50}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.93,0:54:39.06,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 走这边 - 把嘴闭上\N{\fs50}- This way. - Shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.70,0:54:56.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走后门\N{\fs50}Out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.89,0:55:17.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？ - 嗯\N{\fs50}- Ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.31,0:55:27.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快过来 快过来 快过来 我把住了\N{\fs50}Come here. Come here. Come here. I got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.78,0:55:30.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.44,0:56:07.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！快上马！\N{\fs50}Joel! Get on the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.99,0:56:10.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快上马\N{\fs50}Get on the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.24,0:56:13.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.45,0:56:18.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,抓住他！\N{\fs50}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.33,0:56:19.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fs50}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.00,0:56:21.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fs50}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.46,0:56:23.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fs50}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.17,0:56:26.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的！\N{\fs50}You motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.22,0:56:36.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们没跟着我们 我觉得我们安全了\N{\fs50}They're not following us. I think we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.60,0:56:39.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.56,0:56:42.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 不不不！操！\N{\fs50}Joel, no, no, no! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.06,0:56:43.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fs50}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.69,0:56:45.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:47.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.03,0:56:50.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.53,0:56:53.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 你快睁眼啊\N{\fs50}Joel, open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.11,0:56:55.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,睁开眼 乔尔 你得起来\N{\fs50}Open your eyes. Joel, you gotta get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.37,0:57:00.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没你我他妈做不成这事\N{\fs50}I can't fuckin' do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:03.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道我他妈要去哪儿 也不知道他妈要做啥\N{\fs50}I don't know where the fuck I'm going, what the fuck I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.67,0:57:05.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.17,0:57:12.31,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,Depeche Mode《Never Let Me Down Again》，发表于1987年
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.84,0:57:12.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fs50}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:16.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 求你了\N{\fs50}Joel, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.76,0:57:25.73,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我要和最好的朋友一同出发 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ I'm taking a ride with my best friend ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.69,0:57:35.45,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我希望他不再令我失望 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ I hope he never lets me down again ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.62,0:57:44.62,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 他知道他要带我去哪儿 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ He knows where he's taking me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.62,0:57:48.71,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 去到我想去的地方 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Taking me where I want to be ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.71,0:57:55.80,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我和最好的朋友一同出发 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ And I'm taking a ride with my best friend ♪
