Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.23,0:58:12.90,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 再不想下去 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Never wanna come down ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.90,0:58:19.03,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 再不想脚尖落地 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Never wanna put my feet back down on the ground ♪
